  "question": {
    "text": "A block of wood floats in water with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>th</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;of its volume submerged. If the same block just floate in a liquid, the density of liquid in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is",
